  "caveat": "These are source-bound Census 2022 SAS employer-industry revenue estimates in nominal millions of dollars, released under different publication vintages. Benchmark revision differences across parent truck transportation NAICS 484 and child NAICS 484121 truckload and 484122 long-distance LTL do NOT measure invoice mischarges or cash recoveries. Parent and children overlap, and the remaining parent revenue is an arithmetic residual—not a separate directly measured NAICS industry or an independent sample. The revised 2022 CV raw zero cannot certify zero survey uncertainty. The 2022 AIES historical estimates were constructed using legacy-linkage procedures, not independently fielded 2022 AIES."
